MID_MV12_05: <SH>
MID_MV12_05_m001: (attack exert)
MID_MV12_05_m002: Impressive!
MID_MV12_05_m003: (attack exert)
MID_MV12_05_m004: What?!
MID_MV12_05_m005: Not today!
MID_MV12_05_m006: Diego!
MID_MV12_05_m007: Appreciated, Nathan!
MID_MV12_05_m008: I owe you one!
MID_MV12_05_m009: That's seven you owe me, Creek. Bill's coming due.
MID_MV12_05_m010: He's going...for her mask...
MID_MV12_05_m011: (battle exerts)
MID_MV12_05_m012: (battle exerts)
MID_MV12_05_m013: (battle exerts)
MID_MV12_05_m014: No!
MID_MV12_05_m015: I will reveal...your true face!
MID_MV12_05_m016: Enough! I'm done!
MID_MV12_05_m017: Now, out of my way!
MID_MV12_05_m018: Now yield.
MID_MV12_05_m019: (gasping)
MID_MV12_05_m020: (exert)
MID_MV12_05_m021: (exert)
MID_MV12_05_m022: (surprised cry)
MID_MV12_05_m023: (exert for lunge)
MID_MV12_05_m024: (exert)
MID_MV12_05_m025: (exert, knocked back)
MID_MV12_05_m026: (strained gasps, short resolved sound)
MID_MV12_05_m027: Well, what have we here?
MID_MV12_05_m028: As though a goddess has appeared before us...
MID_MV12_05_m029: Wh...what should I do?
MID_MV12_05_m030: (crowd cheering)
MID_MV12_05_m031: Oh...
MID_MV12_05_m032: She... Why does her face look to be a mirror of yours?
MID_MV12_05_m033: Yu Phas?
MID_MV12_05_m034: (seething anger)